    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "resources": {
              "requests": {
                "cpu": "1"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

This is the final attempt at a focused patch before reporting failure.

